Task 3: Test A/B Testing Setup
Subtask 3.1: Implement Header-Based Routing for A/B Testing
Create A/B testing Virtual Service:
Create the file k8s-configs/virtual-service-ab-testing.yaml:

apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1
kind: VirtualService
metadata:
  name: myapp-virtual-service
spec:
  hosts:
  - "*"
  gateways:
  - myapp-gateway
  http:
  # Route for beta users (header-based)
  - match:
    - headers:
        user-group:
          exact: beta
    route:
    - destination:
        host: myapp-service
        subset: v2
      weight: 100
  # Route for premium users (header-based)
  - match:
    - headers:
        user-type:
          exact: premium
    route:
    - destination:
        host: myapp-service
        subset: v2
      weight: 100
  # Default route with traffic splitting
  - match:
    - uri:
        prefix: /
    route:
    - destination:
        host: myapp-service
        subset: v1
      weight: 80
    - destination:
        host: myapp-service
        subset: v2
      weight: 20
Apply the A/B testing configuration:
